{
 "id": "bigville_world_news",
 "version": "1.0.0",
 "depends_on": [],
 "self_load_only": true,
 "description": "BIGVILLE R11 (block 259000) -- NEWS from the frontier (GIANTVILLE). The wider world is the frontier: unknown = absence, first-class -- with NO traveller a resident has NO Giantville belief (the place stays unknown). bw_news_secondhand: a traveller brings a NewsItem `about` Giantville; a resident with comprehend_armed and NO belief yet folds it into a SECOND-HAND GiantvilleBelief{provenance_hearsay:1} whose confidence is the teller's `credibility` (distortable -> a less credible teller yields a lower-confidence belief). bw_belief_grounded: a resident who VISITED Giantville grounds it FIRST-HAND -- GiantvilleBelief{provenance_grounded:1, confidence:1.0}. The grounding boundary applied to a PLACE: hearsay (ungrounded, lower confidence) vs grounded-by-visit, both glass-box (you can read whose belief is knowledge and whose is rumor). A minimal graph-native fold stands in for the 244/246 comprehension pipeline (honest residual). Zero new Rust.",
 "nodes": [],
 "edges": [],
 "productions": [],
 "concepts": [],
 "rules": [
  {
   "name": "bw_news_secondhand",
   "match": [
    [
     "res",
     "hears",
     "news"
    ],
    [
     "news",
     "about",
     "place"
    ]
   ],
   "where": {
    "type": "And",
    "items": [
     {
      "type": "Eq",
      "a": {
       "type": "Plus",
       "items": [
        {
         "type": "Attr",
         "node": {
          "type": "Var",
          "name": "res"
         },
         "key": "comprehend_armed"
        },
        {
         "type": "Lit",
         "value": 0.0
        }
       ]
      },
      "b": {
       "type": "Lit",
       "value": 1.0
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "Not",
      "arg": {
       "type": "Exists",
       "source": {
        "type": "Neighbours",
        "node": {
         "type": "Var",
         "name": "res"
        },
        "edge_type": "giantville_belief",
        "any_type": false
       },
       "var_name": "_x",
       "predicate": {
        "type": "Lit",
        "value": 1.0
       }
      }
     }
    ]
   },
   "effects": [
    [
     "add_node",
     "blf",
     "GiantvilleBelief",
     {
      "provenance_hearsay": 1.0,
      "provenance_grounded": 0.0,
      "confidence": {
